Third-party components
======================

The prebuilt/ directory in each release tarball -- the Wine DLLs, hidclass.sys,
wineusb.sys and wineusb.so.

These are NOT original works of this repository, and are not kept in it: they
are built by .github/workflows/release.yaml and attached to each release. They
are compiled from the Wine source tree with the patches in patches/ applied,
and are therefore derivative works of Wine, licensed under the GNU Lesser
General Public License version 2.1 or later (LGPL-2.1-or-later).

  Upstream source : https://dl.winehq.org/wine/source/
  Version         : see WINE_VERSION (also prebuilt/BUILT_AGAINST in a release)
  Modifications   : every patch in patches/
  Rebuild         : scripts/build-wine-dlls.sh

The complete corresponding source is the upstream Wine tarball for the version
named in WINE_VERSION, plus the patches in patches/. Together with
scripts/build-wine-dlls.sh these reproduce the binaries exactly.

